          "id": "code-ml-35-1-ch35_1_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Single-Definition Transform vs 4 Sumber Train-Serve Skew (AUC Jatuh 0.6923 -> 0.4409)",
          "language": "python",
