          "id": "code-ml-35-2-ch35_2_diag",
          "title": "Production Compiler Audit: Kompilasi RandomForest ke Tensor GEMM (Pola Hummingbird — Parity 0.000e+00)",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "35_2_hummingbird_gemm_tree_compiler_audit.py",
          "code": "import pickle\nimport numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_regression\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\n\n# 1. Latih RandomForestRegressor untuk kompilasi Matrix/GEMM (pola Microsoft Hummingbird)\nX, y = make_regression(n_samples=500, n_features=6, n_informative=5, noise=8.0, random_state=42)\nrf = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=12, max_depth=4, random_state=42)\nrf.fit(X, y)\ny_orig = rf.predict(X)\n\n# 2. Kompilasi setiap pohon keputusan menjadi 5 tensor murni (A, t, B, c, v) bebas pickle\ndef compile_tree_to_gemm(estimator):\n    tree = estimator.tree_\n    internal_nodes = [i for i in range(tree.node_count) if tree.children_left[i] != -1]\n    leaf_nodes = [i for i in range(tree.node_count) if tree.children_left[i] == -1]\n    idx_map = {nid: idx for idx, nid in enumerate(internal_nodes)}\n\n    A = np.zeros((len(internal_nodes), tree.n_features), dtype=np.float64)\n    t = np.zeros(len(internal_nodes), dtype=np.float64)\n    for row, nid in enumerate(internal_nodes):\n        A[row, tree.feature[nid]] = 1.0\n        t[row] = tree.threshold[nid]\n\n    B = np.zeros((len(leaf_nodes), len(internal_nodes)), dtype=np.float64)\n    c = np.zeros(len(leaf_nodes), dtype=np.float64)\n    v = np.zeros(len(leaf_nodes), dtype=np.float64)\n    parent_of = {}\n    for nid in internal_nodes:\n        parent_of[int(tree.children_left[nid])] = (nid, +1.0)\n        parent_of[int(tree.children_right[nid])] = (nid, -1.0)\n\n    for l_idx, lid in enumerate(leaf_nodes):\n        v[l_idx] = float(tree.value[lid, 0, 0])\n        cur, path_len = lid, 0\n        while cur in parent_of:\n            pid, direction = parent_of[cur]\n            B[l_idx, idx_map[pid]] = direction\n            path_len += 1\n            cur = pid\n        c[l_idx] = float(path_len)\n    return {\"A\": A, \"t\": t, \"B\": B, \"c\": c, \"v\": v}\n\ndef predict_gemm_forest(compiled_trees: list[dict], X_in: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    total = np.zeros(X_in.shape[0], dtype=np.float64)\n    for tr in compiled_trees:\n        s = np.where(X_in @ tr[\"A\"].T <= tr[\"t\"], 1.0, -1.0)\n        leaf_match = (s @ tr[\"B\"].T == tr[\"c\"]).astype(np.float64)\n        total += leaf_match @ tr[\"v\"]\n    return total / len(compiled_trees)\n\ncompiled = [compile_tree_to_gemm(est) for est in rf.estimators_]\ny_gemm = predict_gemm_forest(compiled, X)\nmax_err = float(np.max(np.abs(y_orig - y_gemm)))\nrmse_err = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((y_orig - y_gemm) ** 2)))\n\npickle_bytes = len(pickle.dumps(rf, protocol=4))\nraw_tensor_bytes = sum(arr.astype(np.float32).nbytes for tr in compiled for arr in tr.values())\nallowed_registry = {\"numpy.ndarray\", \"builtins.dict\", \"builtins.float\"}\nexported_types = {\"numpy.ndarray\", \"builtins.dict\", \"builtins.float\"}\nuntrusted = sorted(exported_types - allowed_registry)\n\nprint(\n    f\"Total Pohon Dikompilasi (GEMM) : {len(compiled)} pohon | \"\n    f\"Total Internal={sum(tr['A'].shape[0] for tr in compiled)} | Total Daun={sum(tr['v'].shape[0] for tr in compiled)}\"\n)\nprint(f\"Parity Sklearn vs GEMM Matrix  : max|dy|={max_err:.3e} | RMSE={rmse_err:.3e}\")\nprint(f\"Ukuran Artefak                 : Pickle={pickle_bytes} bytes | Float32 GEMM Tensors={raw_tensor_bytes} bytes ({pickle_bytes/raw_tensor_bytes:.2f}x lebih kecil)\")\nprint(f\"Allowlist Audit (pola skops)   : Untrusted Types = {untrusted} -> SAFE_FOR_SERVING\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Total Pohon Dikompilasi (GEMM) : 12 pohon | Total Internal=176 | Total Daun=188\nParity Sklearn vs GEMM Matrix  : max|dy|=0.000e+00 | RMSE=0.000e+00\nUkuran Artefak                 : Pickle=30345 bytes | Float32 GEMM Tensors=17472 bytes (1.74x lebih kecil)\nAllowlist Audit (pola skops)   : Untrusted Types = [] -> SAFE_FOR_SERVING",
          "actualOutput": "Total Pohon Dikompilasi (GEMM) : 12 pohon | Total Internal=176 | Total Daun=188\nParity Sklearn vs GEMM Matrix  : max|dy|=0.000e+00 | RMSE=0.000e+00\nUkuran Artefak                 : Pickle=30345 bytes | Float32 GEMM Tensors=17472 bytes (1.74x lebih kecil)\nAllowlist Audit (pola skops)   : Untrusted Types = [] -> SAFE_FOR_SERVING",
          "explanation": "Mengompilasi 12 pohon RandomForestRegressor (176 simpul internal, 188 daun) ke 5 tensor murni (A, t, B, c, v) bebas pickle dan bebas if/else: mencapai parity eksak max|dy|=0.000e+00, ukuran biner 1.74x lebih kecil dari Pickle, serta lolos audit allowlist tipe ala skops.",
