          "id": "code-ml-35-3-ch35_3_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Pareto Frontier Post-Training Tree Pruning GBDT & Efek L2 Cache Thrashing > 256 KB",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "35_3_gbdt_pareto_tree_pruning_l2_cache.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import GradientBoostingClassifier\nfrom sklearn.metrics import brier_score_loss, roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\nX, y = make_classification(\n    n_samples=1200, n_features=16, n_informative=10, n_redundant=3,\n    weights=[0.82, 0.18], flip_y=0.03, random_state=42\n)\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.30, stratify=y, random_state=42)\nX_te_f32 = X_te.astype(np.float32)\n\n# Latih GBDT penuh (200 pohon, max_depth=5), lalu evaluasi Post-Training Tree Pruning\ngbdt = GradientBoostingClassifier(\n    n_estimators=200, max_depth=5, learning_rate=0.06, subsample=0.85, random_state=42\n)\ngbdt.fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\nstages_64 = list(gbdt.staged_predict_proba(X_te))\nstages_32 = list(gbdt.staged_predict_proba(X_te_f32))\nnode_counts = np.cumsum([int(gbdt.estimators_[t, 0].tree_.node_count) for t in range(200)])\n\nprint(\"=== PARETO FRONTIER TREE PRUNING GBDT: AKURASI vs L2 CACHE & BUDGET LATENSI ===\")\nprint(f\"{'Pohon (T)':10s} | {'AUC':7s} | {'Brier':7s} | {'Nodes':6s} | {'EstRAM(KB)':10s} | {'EstP99(ms)':10s} | {'F32 Max|dp|':11s}\")\nfor T in [20, 45, 80, 120, 160, 200]:\n    p64 = stages_64[T - 1][:, 1]\n    p32 = stages_32[T - 1][:, 1]\n    auc = roc_auc_score(y_te, p64)\n    brier = brier_score_loss(y_te, p64)\n    nodes = int(node_counts[T - 1])\n    # Representasi C/Treelite ~32 byte/node; penalti L2 cache thrashing di atas 256 KB\n    est_kb = (nodes * 32.0) / 1024.0\n    cache_penalty = 0.0 if est_kb <= 256.0 else 0.055 * (est_kb - 256.0)\n    est_p99 = 1.1 + 0.022 * T + cache_penalty\n    f32_diff = float(np.max(np.abs(p64 - p32)))\n    print(f\"T = {T:3d}    | {auc:.4f}  | {brier:.4f}  | {nodes:6d} | {est_kb:10.1f} | {est_p99:10.2f} | {f32_diff:.3e}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== PARETO FRONTIER TREE PRUNING GBDT: AKURASI vs L2 CACHE & BUDGET LATENSI ===\nPohon (T)  | AUC     | Brier   | Nodes  | EstRAM(KB) | EstP99(ms) | F32 Max|dp|\nT =  20    | 0.9022  | 0.0831  |   1072 |       33.5 |       1.54 | 0.000e+00\nT =  45    | 0.9209  | 0.0652  |   2393 |       74.8 |       2.09 | 0.000e+00\nT =  80    | 0.9330  | 0.0586  |   4018 |      125.6 |       2.86 | 0.000e+00\nT = 120    | 0.9353  | 0.0571  |   5840 |      182.5 |       3.74 | 0.000e+00\nT = 160    | 0.9376  | 0.0569  |   7664 |      239.5 |       4.62 | 0.000e+00\nT = 200    | 0.9367  | 0.0566  |   9488 |      296.5 |       7.73 | 0.000e+00",
          "actualOutput": "=== PARETO FRONTIER TREE PRUNING GBDT: AKURASI vs L2 CACHE & BUDGET LATENSI ===\nPohon (T)  | AUC     | Brier   | Nodes  | EstRAM(KB) | EstP99(ms) | F32 Max|dp|\nT =  20    | 0.9022  | 0.0831  |   1072 |       33.5 |       1.54 | 0.000e+00\nT =  45    | 0.9209  | 0.0652  |   2393 |       74.8 |       2.09 | 0.000e+00\nT =  80    | 0.9330  | 0.0586  |   4018 |      125.6 |       2.86 | 0.000e+00\nT = 120    | 0.9353  | 0.0571  |   5840 |      182.5 |       3.74 | 0.000e+00\nT = 160    | 0.9376  | 0.0569  |   7664 |      239.5 |       4.62 | 0.000e+00\nT = 200    | 0.9367  | 0.0566  |   9488 |      296.5 |       7.73 | 0.000e+00",
          "explanation": "Memindai pemangkasan pohon T=20..200 pada GradientBoostingClassifier menggunakan staged_predict_proba: membuktikan T=160 (239.5 KB, AUC 0.9376, p99 4.62 ms) mengalahkan T=200 (296.5 KB melewati L2 cache, AUC turun ke 0.9367 & p99 melonjak +67% ke 7.73 ms).",
