          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef quantize_and_tail_audit(W: np.ndarray, X: np.ndarray, p_single_tail: float, fanout_k: int):\n    W = np.asarray(W, dtype=np.float64)\n    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=np.float64)\n    scales = np.maximum(np.max(np.abs(W), axis=1, keepdims=True) / 127.0, 1e-12)\n    q = np.clip(np.round(W / scales), -127, 127).astype(np.int8)\n    scales_f32 = scales.astype(np.float32)\n    W_deq = q.astype(np.float64) * scales_f32.astype(np.float64)\n    y_fp64 = X @ W.T\n    y_int8 = X @ W_deq.T\n    max_abs_err = float(np.max(np.abs(y_fp64 - y_int8)))\n    comp_ratio = float(W.nbytes) / float(q.nbytes + scales_f32.nbytes)\n    fanout_tail_prob = 1.0 - (1.0 - p_single_tail) ** fanout_k\n    return (round(max_abs_err, 6), round(comp_ratio, 4), round(fanout_tail_prob, 6))\n```"
