          "code": "import math\nimport numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n\n# Guardrail Error Rate Canary: H0 (Sehat p0=0.010) vs H1 (Rusak p1=0.025)\np0, p1 = 0.010, 0.025\nalpha, beta = 0.01, 0.05\nA = math.log((1.0 - beta) / alpha)\nB = math.log(beta / (1.0 - alpha))\n\nllr_1 = math.log(p1 / p0)\nllr_0 = math.log((1.0 - p1) / (1.0 - p0))\nkl_h1 = p1 * llr_1 + (1.0 - p1) * llr_0\nasn_h1_theory = ((1.0 - beta) * A + beta * B) / kl_h1\n\ndef sim_sprt_and_naive(true_p: float, n_trials: int = 800, max_n: int = 2600):\n    X = rng.binomial(1, true_p, size=(n_trials, max_n))\n    llr_cum = np.cumsum(np.where(X == 1, llr_1, llr_0), axis=1)\n\n    hit_a = llr_cum >= A\n    hit_b = llr_cum <= B\n    t_a = np.where(np.any(hit_a, axis=1), np.argmax(hit_a, axis=1) + 1, max_n + 1)\n    t_b = np.where(np.any(hit_b, axis=1), np.argmax(hit_b, axis=1) + 1, max_n + 1)\n\n    sprt_rb = (t_a < t_b) & (t_a <= max_n)\n    stop_n = np.minimum(np.minimum(t_a, t_b), max_n)\n\n    # Anti-pattern: Naive Repeated Peeking z-test tiap 50 request pada alpha=0.01\n    peeks = np.arange(50, max_n + 1, 50)\n    cum_err = np.cumsum(X, axis=1)[:, peeks - 1]\n    phat = cum_err / peeks\n    se0 = np.sqrt(p0 * (1.0 - p0) / peeks)\n    naive_rb = np.any((phat - p0) / se0 >= 2.3263, axis=1)\n    return float(np.mean(sprt_rb)), float(np.mean(stop_n)), float(np.mean(naive_rb))\n\nfp_sprt, asn_h0, fp_naive = sim_sprt_and_naive(p0)\ntp_sprt, asn_h1, tp_naive = sim_sprt_and_naive(p1)\n\nprint(f\"Wald SPRT Bounds (alpha={alpha}, beta={beta}): A_rollback={A:+.4f} | B_promote={B:+.4f} | KL(p1||p0)={kl_h1:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"[H0: Model Sehat p=0.010] False Rollback SPRT = {fp_sprt:6.2%} (Target <= 1.00%) | Naive Peeking = {fp_naive:6.2%} (INFLASI >10x!)\")\nprint(f\"[H1: Model Rusak p=0.025] Deteksi (Power) SPRT= {tp_sprt:6.2%} (Target >= 95.0%) | Naive Peeking = {tp_naive:6.2%}\")\nprint(f\"Rata-rata Sampel Deteksi H1 (ASN): Empiris={asn_h1:.1f} req vs Teori Wald={asn_h1_theory:.1f} req (pada 15 req/dtk -> {asn_h1/15.0:.1f} dtk!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Wald SPRT Bounds (alpha=0.01, beta=0.05): A_rollback=+4.5539 | B_promote=-2.9857 | KL(p1||p0)=0.008021\n[H0: Model Sehat p=0.010] False Rollback SPRT =  0.25% (Target <= 1.00%) | Naive Peeking = 11.25% (INFLASI >10x!)\n[H1: Model Rusak p=0.025] Deteksi (Power) SPRT= 95.88% (Target >= 95.0%) | Naive Peeking = 100.00%\nRata-rata Sampel Deteksi H1 (ASN): Empiris=570.0 req vs Teori Wald=520.7 req (pada 15 req/dtk -> 38.0 dtk!)",
          "actualOutput": "Wald SPRT Bounds (alpha=0.01, beta=0.05): A_rollback=+4.5539 | B_promote=-2.9857 | KL(p1||p0)=0.008021\n[H0: Model Sehat p=0.010] False Rollback SPRT =  0.25% (Target <= 1.00%) | Naive Peeking = 11.25% (INFLASI >10x!)\n[H1: Model Rusak p=0.025] Deteksi (Power) SPRT= 95.88% (Target >= 95.0%) | Naive Peeking = 100.00%\nRata-rata Sampel Deteksi H1 (ASN): Empiris=570.0 req vs Teori Wald=520.7 req (pada 15 req/dtk -> 38.0 dtk!)",
